A(('call', 'Boundaries to Remember',
   'No number for the saved and no explanation of the parts, so no identity for the gate, the master, the door, those outside or those from the four directions. No detail carried in from the Great Banquet, the Ten Virgins or the Sermon on the Mount. Striving, knocking, eating and drinking are actions in a scene, not steps of salvation. The Body of Christ is none of the parts of this passage. The lessons are principles of conduct, not a transfer of Kingdom identity to the Body.'))
